'''Description:''' ([[prestige class|PRESTIGE CLASS]])  The Duelist is a nimble, intelligent fighter trained in making precise attacks with light weapons, such as the [[rapier]]. Also known as the swashbuckler, the Duelist always takes full advantage of his quick reflexes and wits in a fight. Rather than wearing bulky armor, Duelists feel that the best way to protect themselves is to not get hit at all. 

'''[[Hit die]]''':  d10

'''Proficiencies''': weapons ([[weapon proficiency (martial)|martial]], [[weapon proficiency (simple)|simple]])

'''[[Skill point]]s''': 4 + [[intelligence]] modifier

'''Skills''': [[bluff]], [[discipline]], [[iaijutsu focus]], [[jump]], [[listen]], [[parry]], [[perform]], [[spot]], [[tumble]]

'''[[Saving throw|Primary saving throw(s)]]''': [[reflex]]

'''[[Base attack bonus|Base attack bonus progression]]''':  1 BAB per level

== Requirements ==

'''[[Base attack bonus]]''': +6 

'''[[Skill]]s''': [[tumble]] 5 Ranks, [[perform]] 3 ranks

'''[[Feat]]s''': [[dodge]], [[mobility]], [[weapon finesse]], weapon proficiency ([[weapon proficiency (martial)|martial]], [[weapon proficiency (simple)|simple]], or [[weapon proficiency (rogue)|rogue]])

== Special abilities & feats ==
*Level 1 [[Canny defense]]
*Level 2 [[Thug]]
*Level 3 [[Spring attack]]
*Level 4 [[Grace]] (+2) 
*Level 5 [[Precise strike]] (+1d4) 
*Level 6 [[Acrobatic attack]] (+2) 
*Level 7 [[Elaborate parry]] 
*Level 8 [[Improved initiative]] 
*Level 9 [[Deflect arrows]] 
*Level 10 Precise strike (+2d4) 


==Epic duelist ==
You have become the epitome of graceful, precise lethality. In your hands, a light piercing weapon transforms into a glittering blur of razor sharp steel able to turn any blow and strike past any defense. 


*Level 13 Acrobatic attack (+4)
*Level 15 Precise strike (+3d4) 
*Level 20 Precise strike (+4d4), acrobatic attack (+6)
*Level 25 Precise strike (+5d4) 
*Level 27 Acrobatic attack (+8)
*Level 30 Precise strike (+6d4)


'''Bonus feats''':  13, 16, 19, 22, 25, 28

'''Epic bonus feats''':  [[blinding speed]], [[epic prowess]], [[epic reputation]], [[epic skill focus]], [[epic weapon focus]], [[epic reflexes]], [[improved whirlwind attack]], [[superior initiative]], [[greater two-weapon fighting]], [[great dexterity]]

==Notes==
*Requires the [[PRC Expansion Pack]].
*A duelist loses canny defense, precise strike, and grace while wearing any armor or shield.
